  "recipe": {
    "positive": "Chinese New Year woodblock print (nianhua) technique in the Yangliuqing / Taohuawu tradition: carved-block black outlines printed first, then hand-brushed saturated colour (rose-pink, peach, vermilion, yellow, grass green) slightly overflowing the lines with visible brush-depth variation. Figures are rounded, full-faced and festive, with plump simplified objects; carved lines on faces, hands and clothing stay sparse and summary. Dense auspicious pattern details (peony, plum blossom, cloud, coin lattice, geometric motifs) fill cloth and background in flat bold shapes but stay subordinate to the subject. Symmetrical cheerful arrangement on a cream paper ground. Palette: festive saturated hand-coloured rose/peach pink, vermilion, yellow, grass green, small touches of blue and black outline; no metallic sheen and no volume shading. Principal subjects, identities, actions and relationships follow the current brief, not the reference board. Do not add extra people, deities, animals or a new narrative theme. Ordinary supporting scene details and the source-style ornamental motifs may support the requested scene; when the brief sets an exact count or says only, preserve that restricted inventory. Borrow technique, never the reference scene, props, composition or lettering. Keep modern clothing modern; do not turn requested characters into period-costume figures or decorative babies. Text is default none; only exact text explicitly requested by the brief may appear, with no copied reference text, signature or fake characters.",
    "hard_constraints": [
      "Carved-block black outlines plus hand-brushed saturated colour, with colour slightly overflowing the lines and showing brush-depth variation.",
      "Rounded full-faced festive figures and plump simplified objects with sparse carved summary lines, not realistic proportions or fine rendering.",
      "Auspicious pattern details (cloud, floral, geometric) fill cloth and background densely but never bury the subject.",
      "Festive saturated palette of rose/peach pink, vermilion, yellow and grass green with small blue touches on cream paper; no metallic sheen and no volume shading.",
      "Symmetrical cheerful arrangement; rounded simplified subjects and dense auspicious patterns support the requested scene. Principal subjects, identities, actions and relationships follow the current brief, not the reference board. Do not add extra people, deities, animals or a new narrative theme. Ordinary supporting scene details and the source-style ornamental motifs may support the requested scene; when the brief sets an exact count or says only, preserve that restricted inventory. Borrow technique, never the reference scene, props, composition or lettering. Do not turn requested characters into period costume or decorative babies.",
      "No modern flat guochao vector smoothness, no 3D shading, no realistic proportions.",
      "Default text is none; only exact text explicitly requested by the brief may appear, with no copied reference text, signature or fake characters."
    ],
    "text_mode": [
      "none",
      "native"
    ]
  },
